We have accidentally used the wrong drugs: https://deathpenaltyinfo.org/oklahoma-grand-jury-issues-report-detailing-blatant-violations-of-the-states-execution-protocol

Veterinary euthanasia can occasionally go weird: https://dailymed.nlm.nih.gov/dailymed/lookup.cfm?setid=c885b1d9-db06-47fb-bdb0-4015e06ce08b

https://www.vmd.defra.gov.uk/productinformationdatabase/files/UKPAR_Documents/UKPAR_356920.PDF

