Gallup’s 2025 poll - 52% of US adults supported the death penalty for murder (the lowest support since 1972): https://news.gallup.com/poll/697244/americans-prefer-tempered-crime-fighting-methods.aspx

7% of lethal-injection executions classified as botched: https://deathpenaltyinfo.org/executions/botched-executions/

